<title>USA: Diana gets $4.4 mln from judgment.</title>
<headline>Diana gets $4.4 mln from judgment.</headline>
<dateline>CALABASAS, Calif 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diana Corp said it received $4.4 million from a judgment against a major customer.</p>
<p>In a related matter, it said it recently sold 25 percent of its shares of Concentric Network stock at $12 per share of $396,000.</p>
</text>
